  {
   "body": "> It is also a bit inconsistent that when unchecking Modular services on the left, the NixOS labels just vanish.\n\nthe reasoning there was i agree clutter isn't too nice, but when multiple categories are searched one may well need some kind of way to figure out which of the categories your hit actually applies to. when a single category is searched no such distinction would be needed.\n\n> I would just remove [The NixOS labels] and only add them for modular services. This would also reduce visual noise on the page.\n\nso, these should have further relevance now that home-manager options have been added.\n\nthis isn't so much to say i'm not sympathetic to the concern here, but i'd be open to suggestions on nicer ways to handle this.\n",
