  "body": "Recently the Options Search page has seen some changes and my monk immediately found this unordered list of findings. Due to me not having any idea about Elm I am unable to contribute any fixes for those things, unfortunately.\n\n- The checkboxes are unaligned \n\n<img width=\"351\" height=\"186\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/823c781e-c6e7-4eb4-9466-c98615bdf921\" />\n\n- When changing the checkboxes the border becomes wider and immediately jumping back\n\n<img width=\"524\" height=\"193\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/83990556-61c0-474c-8ef1-7a7656c3dad7\" />\n\n- The NixOS labels exist on all options except 18. I would just remove them and only add them for modular services. This would also reduce visual noise on the page.\n\n<img width=\"460\" height=\"342\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/954ba221-994f-406c-9703-e009afffc706\" />\n\n- It is also a bit inconsistent that when unchecking Modular services on the left, the NixOS labels just vanish.\n\n- The hint to search more precise is not very noticeable. In fact I only noticed it because the option listed is being shifted down and I wondered why that was the case\n\n<img width=\"1320\" height=\"418\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6da84e4-9a4e-40e0-b99f-ba3f7af1ab3c\" />\n\n- Clicking on unstable again and again causes a refresh of the search result and also causes the border getting bigger and jumping back I described above\n\n<img width=\"692\" height=\"396\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f78f998b-4655-461d-b49f-c1eaa1bbe42d\" />\n\n- Linkifying the options is a good idea in itself but now copying them is really hard\n\n<img width=\"493\" height=\"181\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1c17ded-cbfd-4752-ba2e-ef331b97e999\" />\n\n- Clicking on the highlighted preStart causes the filter on the left to be reset (everything is checked again) \n\n<img width=\"747\" height=\"593\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9ea30e3-e4cb-419c-b243-f2b84b533a2d\" />",
